	Is there a difference between the differe of dragon scale mails?

     Of course there is, you silly boy. Each dragon scale mail protects from
     the type of breath attack from that dragon you wear, from anything.
     The hard to pin down one is gray dragon - if you fight a gray, you'll
     have him breathing particles all over you or something silly like that.
     (Easy to kill, too, with an artifact).

     Gray, which is generally considered to be the most valuable, protects
     against all (?) forms of magic attacks, and *possibly* disintegration,
     but I may not be sure about that last bit. =) (Don't try this against
     your god, in short. =)


Should I keep an assortment of 
>different dragon mails?

If you have about a 250 strength, and multiple blessed bags of holding,
why not?

Short answer: DSM of any sort is the heaviest type of armor in the game.
Wearing one with less than an 18 str, and even up to a 25, is going to add
a weight factor onto you (for example, normal will become burdened...and
so on.).

 And is a dragon scale mail the best body armor?

Unquestionably...if you can handle the strain.

